01:08:38.483 --> 01:08:40.314
- You understand, right?
- Yeah.


01:08:42.487 --> 01:08:45.149
- Great. Okay.
- All right, cool.


01:08:45.256 --> 01:08:47.884
- Great.
- All right, so, yeah.


01:08:47.992 --> 01:08:49.425
- Okay.
- You look good.


01:08:49.527 --> 01:08:50.926
Thank you for that.


01:08:55.667 --> 01:08:56.827
Damn it.


01:09:17.388 --> 01:09:20.357
- So, your dad went to go get dinner?
- Yes.


01:09:22.293 --> 01:09:24.318
Is it... Is it far?


01:09:27.165 --> 01:09:28.291
Maybe.


01:09:31.236 --> 01:09:35.297
- So, you have to be...
- Don't come up in here like you know us.


01:09:36.074 --> 01:09:37.405
Oh, goodness.


01:09:38.710 --> 01:09:42.043
I'm Lauryn and these are my sisters,
Sierra and China.


01:09:43.715 --> 01:09:45.842
- Where did you meet my daddy at?
- We met at work.


01:09:45.950 --> 01:09:50.011
I think you guys saw me in court
the other day. Remember?


01:09:50.121 --> 01:09:53.215
- Oh, court? That was you?
- Yeah.


01:09:53.324 --> 01:09:55.349
You look so much older.


01:09:58.797 --> 01:10:02.233
- What did you say your name was again?
- Julia.


01:10:03.034 --> 01:10:06.094
- Ain't that a white-girl name?
- Okay, now, we're supposed to be nice...


01:10:06.204 --> 01:10:07.296
China.


01:10:07.405 --> 01:10:10.135
...and say thank you for helping my daddy
try to get custody of us.


01:10:10.241 --> 01:10:11.799
Oh, it's no problem, really.


01:10:11.910 --> 01:10:14.242
Well, you could try a little harder.


01:10:14.345 --> 01:10:16.779
I've been having migraines
since I've been living there.


01:10:16.881 --> 01:10:18.348
- Migraines?
- Bad migraines.


01:10:18.449 --> 01:10:20.280
- I'm sorry. I'm trying.
- Really bad migraines.


01:10:20.385 --> 01:10:21.750
- Hey.
- Hey, you made it.


01:10:21.853 --> 01:10:23.582
- Yeah.
- Hey, Daddy.


01:10:26.257 --> 01:10:28.555
Yeah, your kids
are certainly gonna be lawyers


01:10:28.693 --> 01:10:30.684
'cause they sure as heck
grilled the hell out of me.


01:10:30.795 --> 01:10:32.592
I bet they did.


01:10:32.697 --> 01:10:35.427
- Hi, girls. What you doing?
- Nothing.


01:10:38.436 --> 01:10:41.667
And she's at school,
but she is not a nice girl at all.


01:10:41.773 --> 01:10:43.104
- No?
- No.


01:10:43.208 --> 01:10:45.608
- Are you a nice lady?
- I try to be.


01:10:46.811 --> 01:10:49.336
I like your hair. Don't you, Sisi?


01:10:50.748 --> 01:10:52.045
It's all right.


01:10:52.517 --> 01:10:54.348
Looks like a weave to me.


01:10:55.320 --> 01:10:56.719
- No, it's not.
- Sierra.


01:10:56.821 --> 01:10:58.550
- What?
- So rude.


01:10:58.656 --> 01:11:00.681
She's so rude. Are you okay, Daddy?


01:11:00.792 --> 01:11:03.283
- I think it's time for y'all to go to bed.
- No, please.


01:11:03.394 --> 01:11:05.658
- Not yet.
- Just five more minutes, not yet.


01:11:05.763 --> 01:11:06.957
- Good night.
- No.


01:11:07.065 --> 01:11:09.158
- Please, I want to talk to Ms. Julia.
- Say good night.


01:11:09.267 --> 01:11:10.928
- Good night, Ms. Julia.
- Thank you.


01:11:11.035 --> 01:11:12.662
Good night.


01:11:12.770 --> 01:11:14.829
- Good night.
- Sierra.


01:11:16.841 --> 01:11:17.865
Bye.


01:11:19.277 --> 01:11:20.301
Bye.


01:11:21.613 --> 01:11:23.137
Tell me what you know.


01:11:23.248 --> 01:11:27.116
You know what?
I'll tell you what I do know.


01:11:27.218 --> 01:11:32.087
I know that you, you're feeling me,
but you won't let yourself go there


01:11:32.190 --> 01:11:35.819
because you care more about what
people think than your own happiness.


01:11:35.927 --> 01:11:36.916
Am I right?


01:11:37.028 --> 01:11:39.656
We could both act like, you know,
the other night never happened.


01:11:39.764 --> 01:11:41.698
- But we both know it did.
- I was drunk.


01:11:41.799 --> 01:11:43.232
- No, no.
- No, I was drunk.


01:11:43.334 --> 01:11:47.327
You was being yourself and like my
mama used to say, God rest her soul,


01:11:47.438 --> 01:11:49.736
"A drunk man never tells no tales."


01:11:51.242 --> 01:11:52.300
What?


01:11:53.745 --> 01:11:55.042
- Touché.
- Yeah.


01:11:56.848 --> 01:11:59.442
- So your mom passed?
- Yeah.


01:12:00.351 --> 01:12:03.047
- My mom passed.
- I'm sorry to hear that.


01:12:05.990 --> 01:12:07.753
- What about your dad?
- Who?


01:12:07.859 --> 01:12:11.124
- Your dad?
- My dad, I don't know my dad.


01:12:11.229 --> 01:12:15.063
I got a whole bunch of brothers and
sisters that I don't know, but that's cool.


01:12:16.868 --> 01:12:19.234
It's funny how life works out.


01:12:19.337 --> 01:12:23.398
You never knew your dad,
but my dad would have killed for a boy.


01:12:23.508 --> 01:12:24.839
- For a boy?
- For a boy.


01:12:24.943 --> 01:12:27.036
- Didn't get one.
- I know the feeling.


01:12:28.046 --> 01:12:30.606
That man pushed me so hard, God.


01:12:33.718 --> 01:12:37.210
I made partner in the firm before I was 28.


01:12:37.322 --> 01:12:39.756
My parents have retired to South Beach.


01:12:41.926 --> 01:12:43.791
I don't know, Ms. Julia. You know what?


01:12:43.895 --> 01:12:47.194
You and I,
we come from two different worlds but...


01:12:47.865 --> 01:12:50.095
Well, there is something
going on here, right?


01:12:57.842 --> 01:12:59.275
- You want me to stop?
- No.


01:12:59.377 --> 01:13:00.639
- No?
- No.


01:13:07.752 --> 01:13:11.848
- Oh, you're on time today.
- Well, he's on time all right.


01:13:11.956 --> 01:13:13.287
Oh, my God!


01:13:15.994 --> 01:13:20.226
- What happened to you?
- Some thugs tried to break in here.


01:13:21.199 --> 01:13:24.532
I fought them out.
Before that happened one of them cut me.


01:13:24.635 --> 01:13:26.296
- Are you all right?
- Yeah, yeah, I'm all right.


01:13:26.404 --> 01:13:27.803
Did you catch them?


01:13:27.905 --> 01:13:31.671
No, it was just some crackhead
trying to get some stuff.


01:13:33.044 --> 01:13:36.810
Yeah, I'm getting too old for this, man.
I'm tired of it.


01:13:36.914 --> 01:13:38.176
They win!


01:13:40.084 --> 01:13:42.211
You know, I was thinking.


01:13:44.555 --> 01:13:48.514
I gotta get rid of this place.
I gotta leave this neighborhood.


01:13:49.560 --> 01:13:53.223
So if you can get together what you can
for a down payment,


01:13:53.331 --> 01:13:56.858
and then you hit me up once a month


01:13:56.968 --> 01:13:59.368
until we reach 10, plus interest


01:14:00.938 --> 01:14:03.839
you can have this place.
Would you do that?


01:14:03.941 --> 01:14:07.342
I mean, sure. What are you saying?
Are you serious, man?


01:14:07.445 --> 01:14:11.074
Yeah, this place is officially yours.


01:14:12.917 --> 01:14:15.852
- I mean, I didn't want it like this.
- Me, neither.


01:14:18.990 --> 01:14:23.086
But you gotta let me come back
and help you from time to time.


01:14:23.194 --> 01:14:25.219
Any time you're ready, man.


01:14:27.532 --> 01:14:28.760
All right.


01:14:28.866 --> 01:14:30.356
Oh, man.


01:14:38.643 --> 01:14:40.270
Congratulations.


01:14:42.613 --> 01:14:46.014
- Is he gonna be all right?
- He'll be fine.


01:14:50.021 --> 01:14:51.454
You see that?


01:14:55.393 --> 01:14:56.758
I see it. Oh, look at that.


01:14:56.861 --> 01:15:00.160
- Can you see it, Ms. Julia?
- I do. Wow.


01:15:02.266 --> 01:15:05.235
So, you know, I'm mad excited.


01:15:05.803 --> 01:15:07.737
I'm gonna get my sign for my new garage.


01:15:07.839 --> 01:15:09.067
- I know.
- I know.


01:15:09.173 --> 01:15:12.472
- Sounds great.
- I know. I'm really excited about that.


01:15:13.511 --> 01:15:14.842
Congratulations.


01:15:16.147 --> 01:15:18.206
- Julia?
- Hey.


01:15:18.316 --> 01:15:20.648
Hey. What are you doing here?


01:15:22.253 --> 01:15:24.687
- Nothing, we were just...
- I'm Monty.


01:15:25.490 --> 01:15:28.084
- I remember you.
- Okay.


01:15:28.192 --> 01:15:31.923
- Can I talk to you for a sec?
- Yeah.


01:15:33.397 --> 01:15:36.491
- What are you doing with this man?
- What? We're just hanging out.


01:15:36.601 --> 01:15:39.468
Are you serious? You like him?


01:15:39.570 --> 01:15:43.301
- He's a nice guy.
- Snap out of it, Julia.


01:15:43.407 --> 01:15:46.672
You are a partner at your firm,
the only black woman at that level.


01:15:46.777 --> 01:15:48.870
What do you think your partners
would think if they knew


01:15:48.980 --> 01:15:51.380
you were sleeping around with the help?


01:15:51.482 --> 01:15:53.848
Are you trying to ruin your life?


01:15:55.286 --> 01:15:57.311
- Hey, Julia, how you doing?
- Good, how you doing?


01:15:57.421 --> 01:15:59.548
- Hey, baby, you ready?
- Yeah.


01:16:08.466 --> 01:16:09.956
Come on, guys.


01:16:23.247 --> 01:16:27.911
I think there'll be some people
who are disappointed in me behind this.


01:16:31.389 --> 01:16:34.449
I mean, you know who I am.
I'm from the streets.


01:16:35.593 --> 01:16:38.289
- I can't change that.
- I'm not trying to change you.


01:16:38.396 --> 01:16:40.159
- Do I embarrass you?
- No!


01:16:40.264 --> 01:16:43.097
I mean, it's obvious that I do.
And that's okay. That's okay.


01:16:43.201 --> 01:16:45.362
You just gotta tell me that.


01:16:46.771 --> 01:16:49.262
Tell me the truth,
so that way I know how to deal with it.


01:16:49.373 --> 01:16:52.342
Look, I don't know how I feel. Okay?


01:16:52.443 --> 01:16:54.070
But I can't sit here and lie to you,


01:16:54.178 --> 01:16:58.171
and say that I don't think about
who you are and what you have.


01:16:58.282 --> 01:16:59.579
I do.


01:16:59.684 --> 01:17:01.811
You have three daughters,


01:17:01.919 --> 01:17:04.285
one of whom is almost as big as I am.


01:17:05.690 --> 01:17:09.854
This is new for me, Monty,
and it's different, and I'm trying.


01:17:10.461 --> 01:17:13.624
I am trying
and you gotta give me credit for that.


01:17:18.369 --> 01:17:21.236
Can we finish this conversation? Come on.


01:17:21.839 --> 01:17:24.740
- No.
- No? What are you... What...


01:17:24.842 --> 01:17:26.707
I got my girls for like two more hours,


01:17:26.811 --> 01:17:29.245
and I'm not gonna waste my time
dealing with this.


01:17:29.347 --> 01:17:31.542
But I will tell you something.


01:17:33.317 --> 01:17:35.649
You don't have three girls in your life.


01:17:35.753 --> 01:17:38.119
- It's just you.
- Monty. Monty.


01:17:38.723 --> 01:17:40.782
- Monty.
- Big guy, ain't he?


01:17:41.325 --> 01:17:43.054
- He's so pretty.
- Pretty?


01:17:46.664 --> 01:17:49.963
- Look at that one.
- That one's bigger than all of them.


01:17:50.901 --> 01:17:52.163
Yeah.


01:18:05.516 --> 01:18:08.576
I told him,
"Do not bring this chick to my house."


01:18:14.558 --> 01:18:17.186
- Watch the seatbelt. Come on.
- I love you, Daddy.


01:18:20.464 --> 01:18:22.694
- See you later.
- Come on, y'all. Hurry up.


01:18:22.800 --> 01:18:25.530
- Bye, Ms. Julia.
- All right.


01:18:29.940 --> 01:18:34.036
I love y'all. Okay? Y'all be good, okay?


01:18:34.145 --> 01:18:36.807
- Little butterfly. Go ahead.
- Come on, y'all.


01:18:42.586 --> 01:18:43.712
Come on, y'all. Hurry up.


01:18:43.821 --> 01:18:46.449
Shoot, I've been standing out here
all night. I'm tired, too.


01:18:46.557 --> 01:18:49.151
Y'all think y'all the only ones tired? Shoot.


01:18:55.666 --> 01:18:59.158
Just let me explain, Monty.


01:19:04.308 --> 01:19:08.768
The last man that I loved,
he hurt me to my soul.


01:19:10.648 --> 01:19:12.707
We were together six years,


01:19:14.719 --> 01:19:17.984
and he told me it was over
two days before his wedding.


01:19:19.090 --> 01:19:22.059
I trusted him with everything.


01:19:23.327 --> 01:19:29.027
And I've never felt so low
and stupid and humiliated in my life.


01:19:29.767 --> 01:19:34.397
And so I told myself
not to think about you.


01:19:36.374 --> 01:19:39.070
But I couldn't 'cause I do all the time.


01:19:41.679 --> 01:19:43.306
So what are you saying?


01:19:43.414 --> 01:19:47.077
I'm saying that I've been running
from something that already happened.


01:19:47.184 --> 01:19:50.244
And I'm saying that
I fell in love with you, Monty James.


01:19:50.354 --> 01:19:52.845
And I'm saying
that I hope I'm not in this alone.


01:19:52.957 --> 01:19:54.288
You're not.


01:19:54.925 --> 01:19:56.552
You're not alone.


01:20:00.731 --> 01:20:02.028
Come here.


01:20:11.075 --> 01:20:12.599
Your Honor,
the children's own grandmother,


01:20:12.710 --> 01:20:15.907
their maternal grandmother at that,
went down to Child Welfare


01:20:16.013 --> 01:20:17.310
and prepared a written statement


01:20:17.415 --> 01:20:19.576
as to why the children
should be placed with their father.


01:20:19.683 --> 01:20:21.548
Let me see that.


01:20:21.652 --> 01:20:24.018
- Did you know about this?
- Look, I don't know nothing about this.


01:20:24.121 --> 01:20:25.816
I don't know
what they're trying to pull now.


01:20:25.923 --> 01:20:28.892
Your Honor, my client has the means
to take care of these girls.


01:20:28.993 --> 01:20:30.221
And she wants to take care...


01:20:30.327 --> 01:20:33.194
It says here that her mother thought
the means were ill-gotten.


01:20:33.297 --> 01:20:36.266
- Well, that's pure...
- What do you do for a living, Ms. Jackson?


01:20:36.367 --> 01:20:40.098
Well, I don't work, Your Honor,
but my boyfriend does.


01:20:40.204 --> 01:20:41.398
What does he do?


01:20:41.505 --> 01:20:43.996
You know, I mean,
he owns his own businesses.


01:20:44.108 --> 01:20:46.008
And where are the tax returns?


01:20:46.110 --> 01:20:47.805
Well, you know,
we was working on getting them.


01:20:47.912 --> 01:20:50.403
And you know what, Your Honor,
you keep asking me about my stuff,


01:20:50.514 --> 01:20:52.744
you need to be asking Monty
about some of his secrets


01:20:52.850 --> 01:20:54.112
'cause he got a whole lot of them.


01:20:54.218 --> 01:20:55.845
What is she talking about?


01:20:55.953 --> 01:21:01.516
Your Honor, Mr. James was convicted of the
rape of a 16-year-old girl 16 years ago.


01:21:01.625 --> 01:21:03.957
And we're afraid
for the safety of the children.


01:21:04.061 --> 01:21:06.894
Counselor,
what do you have to say about this?


01:21:08.833 --> 01:21:10.824
I wasn't aware, Your Honor.


01:21:10.935 --> 01:21:14.166
It's right here in black and white.
Yeah, he was sentenced to eight years.


01:21:14.271 --> 01:21:17.206
He's been on probation
ever since his release.


01:21:17.308 --> 01:21:19.173
I'll take this matter under advisement.


01:21:19.276 --> 01:21:22.006
I need to review
the circumstances of this case.


01:21:22.112 --> 01:21:23.409
Adjourned.


01:21:27.117 --> 01:21:31.520
So how long has he been screwing you?
Huh? 'Cause I know he can't afford you.


01:21:32.189 --> 01:21:34.316
- Move, move.
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey, hey.


01:21:34.425 --> 01:21:36.154
I'll have to tap that ass.


01:21:36.260 --> 01:21:38.057
Let me explain. Let me explain something.


01:21:38.162 --> 01:21:39.390
- Get away from me.
- Hold on.


01:21:39.497 --> 01:21:40.896
- Let me...
- Get you hands off of me.


01:21:40.998 --> 01:21:42.488
- Wait, let me explain.
- You know what, shut up.


01:21:42.600 --> 01:21:45.569
Shut the hell up. I can't even
stand to look at you, right now.


01:21:45.669 --> 01:21:48.763
I asked you if there were any surprises.
You said no.


01:21:48.873 --> 01:21:49.931
You're a rapist.


01:21:50.040 --> 01:21:52.065
You don't think that's something
that I should have known about?


01:21:52.176 --> 01:21:54.007
- Let me explain.
- Don't you touch me.


01:21:54.144 --> 01:21:56.112
Julia, look. Look. Look.


01:21:56.213 --> 01:21:59.376
Let me ask you a question. Did you
or did you not go to jail for rape?


01:21:59.483 --> 01:22:01.610
- Julia, look. Julia, look.
- Did you go to jail?


01:22:01.719 --> 01:22:03.653
- Did you go to jail for rape, Monty?
- Yes.


01:22:03.787 --> 01:22:04.845
That's all I need to know.


01:22:04.955 --> 01:22:07.753
Do you know what, it doesn't even matter
'cause you're a liar, Monty.


01:22:07.858 --> 01:22:11.385
You're a filthy... God, you're a filthy liar.


01:22:11.495 --> 01:22:16.194
This case is over. Maya will call you and
tell you when to return for the ruling.


01:22:16.300 --> 01:22:20.202
You don't need me anymore, Monty,
and I certainly don't need you.


01:22:30.214 --> 01:22:32.273
So, you like him that much?


01:22:33.384 --> 01:22:35.818
- I fell in love with him.
- Oh, Julia.


01:22:36.954 --> 01:22:40.856
Sweetie, this was supposed to be
a fun thing, not a love thing.


01:22:41.392 --> 01:22:42.552
I know.


01:22:43.928 --> 01:22:45.793
Go ahead, Bren, tell me, "I told you so."


01:22:45.896 --> 01:22:49.263
Oh, girl, you know I'm not gonna do that.


01:22:49.366 --> 01:22:52.096
It's just good that you found out now.


01:22:52.202 --> 01:22:54.067
I'm with Brenda on this.


01:22:54.905 --> 01:22:57.999
Julia, this guy was probably
just after your money.


01:22:58.108 --> 01:23:00.303
He wasn't even like that.


01:23:00.411 --> 01:23:05.474
You know, you guys, he was a hard worker.
And he treated...


01:23:05.583 --> 01:23:08.484
God, he treats those girls
like they are princesses.


01:23:08.586 --> 01:23:11.214
Well, let's not forget he has a record.


01:23:12.790 --> 01:23:14.849
How did I not know he was lying?


01:23:14.959 --> 01:23:18.952
Because he's probably really good at it.
They all are.


01:23:21.432 --> 01:23:27.098
It's like I'm hearing it, you guys,
and I'm trying to understand, but I just...


01:23:27.204 --> 01:23:29.365
It doesn't make sense.


01:23:30.741 --> 01:23:32.003
You know?


01:23:33.143 --> 01:23:36.772
And I can't make my brain believe
that it was all a lie.


01:23:42.152 --> 01:23:44.143
Is it as bad as it sounds?


01:23:45.723 --> 01:23:49.215
Honey, it's as bad as it sounds.


01:23:50.894 --> 01:23:54.625
Jules, just do yourself a favor.


01:23:54.732 --> 01:23:57.064
Forget about this guy.


01:23:57.167 --> 01:23:59.761
He just sounds like a lot of trouble.


01:24:02.373 --> 01:24:03.431
Okay?


01:24:29.733 --> 01:24:31.428
I just want to say...


01:24:50.087 --> 01:24:51.452
It was like that.


01:24:53.157 --> 01:24:55.785
<i>Hi, this is Julia. Leave a message.</i>


01:25:04.268 --> 01:25:05.633
Who that?


01:25:18.649 --> 01:25:20.514
What y'all doing here?


01:25:21.518 --> 01:25:23.110
What y'all doing here?


01:25:24.455 --> 01:25:26.116
Where your mama at?


01:25:27.157 --> 01:25:29.523
What happened, Sisi? What happened?


01:25:31.128 --> 01:25:34.188
Daddy, we don't really care
what the judge says.


01:25:35.165 --> 01:25:37.258
We just want to be with you.


01:25:37.401 --> 01:25:38.834
I'm staying here.


01:25:41.105 --> 01:25:43.096
- How did y'all get here?
- We walked.


01:25:43.207 --> 01:25:45.107
Y'all walked at 3:00 in the morning?


01:25:45.209 --> 01:25:47.939
We can't stay there anymore, Daddy.
I'm sorry.


01:25:48.045 --> 01:25:50.172
- What you talking about?
- Daddy.


01:25:50.280 --> 01:25:52.578
- What happened?
- Joe...


01:25:53.383 --> 01:25:57.410
Joe what? Sisi you can talk to me.
You tell me, what happened?


01:25:58.589 --> 01:26:00.648
- Joe keeps...
- He keeps what?


01:26:01.425 --> 01:26:03.416
Joe keeps hitting China.


01:26:03.527 --> 01:26:04.619
What?


01:26:06.497 --> 01:26:08.055
- Where? Come here. Where?
- On my back.


01:26:08.165 --> 01:26:09.632
On your back?


01:26:10.734 --> 01:26:14.033
Mama was sitting right there.
She didn't even say anything.


01:26:18.308 --> 01:26:22.108
Hold on. Hold on a second.
Come here. He hit you?


01:26:22.212 --> 01:26:24.942
He hit me because I wouldn't stop crying.


01:26:25.048 --> 01:26:27.812
- Daddy, I was so sad.
- Okay.


01:26:27.918 --> 01:26:30.284
Okay, come here. Come here.


01:26:33.757 --> 01:26:36.521
Grandma told me.
Grandma told me to look after y'all.


01:26:36.627 --> 01:26:39.221
I got to look after y'all.


01:26:39.329 --> 01:26:41.593
So y'all gonna stay with me now.


01:26:46.003 --> 01:26:48.403
Y'all gonna stay with me now. Okay?


01:26:48.505 --> 01:26:49.870
Okay?


01:26:49.973 --> 01:26:53.272
Sisi, I'm so sorry. I am so sorry.


01:26:58.015 --> 01:27:01.610
Okay, you gotta stay with me.
It's gonna be all right.


01:27:06.857 --> 01:27:08.188
It's gonna be all right.


01:28:36.013 --> 01:28:37.913
Wait, hold up.


01:28:38.015 --> 01:28:41.451
Monty, Monty. Man, come on.


01:28:41.551 --> 01:28:43.451
<i>Some girls up in here, man.</i>


01:28:43.553 --> 01:28:46.181
Monty, what are you doing, man?


01:28:46.290 --> 01:28:48.690
Come on. What's taking you so long?


01:28:48.792 --> 01:28:51.022
- I'm Monty.
- We know who you are.


01:28:51.128 --> 01:28:52.356
You beat our team.


01:28:52.462 --> 01:28:53.622
- How old are you?
- Eighteen.


01:28:53.730 --> 01:28:55.425
You know, this sure is a nice place
you have here.


01:28:55.532 --> 01:28:56.794
You want to see my room?


01:28:56.900 --> 01:28:58.492
- So you gonna call me?
- Probably not.


01:28:58.602 --> 01:29:00.832
You're just like all the other guys.


01:29:00.938 --> 01:29:02.667
Mandy, what are you doing?
Did he force you?


01:29:02.773 --> 01:29:04.468
- No way. Tell him.
- Mandy.


01:29:05.909 --> 01:29:07.137
- Yes, Daddy.
- What?


01:29:07.244 --> 01:29:08.802
- Sir, I didn't do anything.
- Shut up.


01:29:08.912 --> 01:29:11.540
- I didn't do anything. It was her idea.
- Shut up, superstar.


01:29:11.648 --> 01:29:13.411
- Tell him, I didn't do anything.
- Call the police.


01:29:13.517 --> 01:29:15.917
Tell him, Amanda.
If you don't tell the truth, I'm going to jail.


01:29:16.019 --> 01:29:17.782
- Tell him the truth.
- You're ball days are over.


01:29:17.888 --> 01:29:19.378
- You got me?
- I didn't do nothing.


01:29:19.489 --> 01:29:21.457
<i>- Shut up!
- I didn't do nothing.</i>


01:29:21.558 --> 01:29:22.889
<i>- Shut up!
- I didn't do...</i>


01:29:22.993 --> 01:29:25.291
<i>Get you hands off of me.
I can't even stand to look at you.</i>


01:29:25.395 --> 01:29:27.124
<i>You're a rapist.</i>


01:29:50.053 --> 01:29:52.317
I bet you
he won't ever take our money again.


01:29:52.422 --> 01:29:56.290
I know, that's right.
Got to keep it straight, Jen.


01:29:56.393 --> 01:29:58.588
You know I got your back, right, baby?


01:29:58.695 --> 01:30:00.890
That's why you my girl.


01:30:00.998 --> 01:30:03.967
You know, I want to go see that movie
with the dude with the ax.


01:30:04.067 --> 01:30:05.659
No, no, no, it's the chain saw.


01:30:05.769 --> 01:30:08.260
Baby, you know
if we went to see that movie...


01:30:20.717 --> 01:30:22.184
Check it out.


01:30:22.686 --> 01:30:24.984
Oh, snap. Load up. Load up.


01:31:29.686 --> 01:31:30.880
Stop it!


01:32:00.584 --> 01:32:02.779
<i>There was a near riot today
in the Edgewood community.</i>


01:32:02.886 --> 01:32:05.446
<i>Police officers were called in
to break up a fight</i>


01:32:05.555 --> 01:32:09.252
<i>between local gang members
and residents who had had enough.</i>


01:32:09.359 --> 01:32:11.987
<i>Among those arrested was Monty James.</i>


01:32:12.095 --> 01:32:15.121
<i>You may remember Monty James,
a high school basketball star,</i>


01:32:15.232 --> 01:32:17.996
<i>who was falsely convicted in 1990</i>


01:32:18.101 --> 01:32:22.094
<i>for allegedly having non-consensual sex
with a 17-year-old girl.</i>


01:32:22.806 --> 01:32:25.400
I'm assuming you have
admissible evidence this time.


01:32:25.509 --> 01:32:26.635
Yes, Your Honor.


01:32:26.743 --> 01:32:29.303
The police seized
several pounds of marijuana,


01:32:29.412 --> 01:32:31.004
hidden in the defendant's vehicle.


01:32:31.114 --> 01:32:32.411
Subsequent search of the residence


01:32:32.516 --> 01:32:35.417
turned up several kilograms
of crack cocaine.


01:32:35.519 --> 01:32:37.350
This time, Your Honor,
we have a valid warrant.


01:32:37.454 --> 01:32:40.514
Your Honor, even though
they served a search warrant,


01:32:40.624 --> 01:32:42.785
they still have no witnesses.


01:32:46.730 --> 01:32:49.426
Your Honor, I'll testify.


01:33:12.656 --> 01:33:16.148
Congratulations,
it looks like you have a case.


01:33:16.259 --> 01:33:20.252
Take them into custody.
There will be no bond.


01:33:20.363 --> 01:33:22.092
- Next case.
- Wait, get your hands off of me.


01:33:22.199 --> 01:33:25.066
The State of Georgia versus Monty James.


01:33:27.971 --> 01:33:33.034
Order. Order in this court! All of
you, quiet, or I'll have you removed.


01:33:33.410 --> 01:33:35.469
I will have order.


01:33:37.814 --> 01:33:39.338
Order.


01:33:39.449 --> 01:33:40.939
Order.


01:33:41.051 --> 01:33:42.746
I said order!


01:33:43.987 --> 01:33:47.013
- Who's here for the defense?
- I am, Your Honor.


01:33:47.958 --> 01:33:49.585
Ms. Rossmore.


01:33:49.693 --> 01:33:52.093
May I take a second, please?


01:33:52.195 --> 01:33:53.890
What you doing here?


01:33:53.997 --> 01:33:56.295
I'm sorry, I didn't give
you a chance to explain,


01:33:56.399 --> 01:34:00.165
and if you don't ever want to speak
to me again, I completely understand.


01:34:00.270 --> 01:34:01.828
Let me help you.


01:34:02.839 --> 01:34:04.272
Monty, just let me help you.


01:34:04.374 --> 01:34:06.365
Just get me back to my kids.


01:34:08.011 --> 01:34:09.569
Ms. Rossmore?


01:34:11.414 --> 01:34:14.645
Your Honor, there's no evidence
my client committed any criminal act.


01:34:14.751 --> 01:34:16.616
The State has no case against him.


01:34:16.720 --> 01:34:18.051
We demand a preliminary hearing


01:34:18.154 --> 01:34:20.088
and request the State be required
to show probable cause.


01:34:20.190 --> 01:34:23.159
Your Honor, I'm sure that one of these
witnesses can attest to the fact


01:34:23.260 --> 01:34:26.593
that Mr. James drove his vehicle
into the previous defendant's vehicle.


01:34:26.696 --> 01:34:28.095
It was an accident.


01:34:28.198 --> 01:34:31.292
I'm sure that the subsequent fistfight
was an accident also there, Counselor.


01:34:31.401 --> 01:34:32.595
Where are the witnesses?


01:34:32.702 --> 01:34:34.602
Your Honor,
the entire neighborhood saw this.


01:34:34.704 --> 01:34:35.898
I'm sure we have a witness.


01:34:36.006 --> 01:34:39.407
May I have one of the witnesses
please stand at this time?


01:34:51.621 --> 01:34:53.953
- Your Honor...
- I'm dismissing the case.


01:35:10.206 --> 01:35:11.537
I love you,


01:35:13.877 --> 01:35:16.038
and I'm sorry for everything.


01:35:43.940 --> 01:35:47.535
Oh, man. Come on, man.
I can't believe this.


01:35:48.778 --> 01:35:50.803
The whole neighborhood remembered.


01:35:50.914 --> 01:35:52.108
- Daddy!
- Daddy!


01:36:13.169 --> 01:36:14.659
Come here, baby.


01:36:20.310 --> 01:36:23.768
- It's all on you now, boy.
- I love you, man. I appreciate it.


01:36:23.880 --> 01:36:25.142
Bye, babies.

